", "qa_status": "PASS", "reasoning_effort": "high", "run_id": "run-20261019-categories-remaining-p016-gpt61sol", "schema_version": 2, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f33b15bcaff218162f76e9666285051808fdf6de2c53efbbe30f6be9c95c2401", "stage": "STRUCTURE_OK", "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "2-category", "target_term": "2-范畴"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表的"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "fibred", "target_term": "纤维化"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表的"}, {"source_term": "fibred", "target_term": "纤维化"}, {"source_term": "groupoids", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "equivalences", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "invariant", "target_term": "不变"}, {"source_term": "fibred", "target_term": "纤维化"}, {"source_term": "groupoids", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "fibred", "target_term": "纤维化"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n因此，很容易想到，将2-范畴（2-category）中一个“可表的（representable）”对象（object）定义为范畴（category），它纤维化（fibred）于集合（sets），且其关联预层（presheaf）是可表的（representable）；这个2-范畴由纤维化（fibred）于群胚（groupoids）的范畴（categories）构成。然而，这不是一个适用的好定义，因为我们希望这一概念在等价（equivalences）下不变（invariant）。为精确表述这一点，我们研究究竟哪些纤维化（fibred）于群胚（groupoids）的范畴（categories）等价（equivalent）于纤维化（fibred）于集合（sets）的范畴（categories）。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:e8f93d62b2d6e1ee002c7ba9cf4fcc72a8d45e5d0ccb0e5630882bacf48d8f67", "unit_id": "tag:0042:prose-0005", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "拟议对象概念及关联预层的可表性；待决。", "source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表的"}, {"context": "高阶范畴中的对象；待决。", "source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"context": "由群胚纤维化范畴构成的高阶范畴；待决。", "source_term": "2-category", "target_term": "2-范畴"}, {"context": "所比较的纤维化范畴；待决。", "source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "拟议定义中的范畴；待决。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "四次出现的纤维化条件；待决。", "source_term": "fibred", "target_term": "纤维化"}, {"context": "环境及需研究范畴的群胚纤维化条件；待决。", "source_term": "groupoids", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"context": "拟议定义及比较目标的集合纤维化条件；待决。", "source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"context": "关联的预层；待决。", "source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"context": "概念希望保持不变的等价；待决。", "source_term": "equivalences", "target_term": "等价"}, {"context": "希望概念具有的等价不变性；待决。", "source_term": "invariant", "target_term": "不变"}, {"context": "两类纤维化范畴间的等价关系；待决。", "source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}]}
